{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西總統盧拉周日（25日）擊敗前總統博索納羅之子弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro），成功連任。</p><p>弗拉維奧拒絕承認在總統選舉第二輪投票中敗選，又表示今次結果「不可能」及「費解」，並稱應推翻選舉結果。</p><p>（BBC/新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.409523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:25:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:05.384881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536448+00:00","content_hash":"63a9034de96b7671685ed2622cdd4ca3fef804f72d506495fc26c2f24f877028","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}